---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Security"
  description="Before infrastructure, I broke things (responsibly). Hack The Box Hall of Fame and responsible disclosure through official channels."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Security</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">Before infrastructure, I broke things (responsibly).</p>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="htb-heading">
    <h2 id="htb-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hack The Box</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">Hall of Fame.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="disclosure-heading">
    <h2 id="disclosure-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Responsible disclosure</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
      I reported critical findings to NCIIPC and to state government systems through official channels. This page
      does not name those systems or describe the issues.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="practice-heading">
    <h2 id="practice-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Practice</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">Reverse engineering and packet analysis.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 border-t border-line pt-8" aria-labelledby="now-heading">
    <h2 id="now-heading" class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Since then</h2>
    <p class="todo">
      TODO: Priyam — optional closing on how this past shows up in your engineering now. Left blank so the page
      does not invent a moral.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
